## ✨ Animations & Motion System

### Principles
1. **Purposeful** — every animation communicates meaning, not decoration
2. **Fast** — entrance: 300–500ms, exit: 150–250ms
3. **Interruptible** — user can scroll past, no forced waiting
4. **Reduced Motion** — full `prefers-reduced-motion` support via media query

### Animation Catalogue
| Animation | Trigger | Library | Duration |
|---|---|---|---|
| Hero text typewriter | Page load | Framer Motion | 1.5s |
| Navbar scroll shrink | Scroll | CSS Scroll-driven | Instant |
| Section reveal | Scroll into view | Framer Motion `useInView` | 400ms |
