## 🌐 Internationalization (i18n) Requirements

### Full bilingual support: English & Arabic
- **Language switcher**: persists to `localStorage` with key `ahmed_portfolio_lang_v3`
- **RTL auto-switch**: `dir="rtl"` on `<html>`, all CSS layouts must work in both directions
- **Font swap**: Arabic content uses `Cairo`, English uses `Inter` (via `lang` attribute CSS)
- **Translation files**: `/public/locales/en/translation.json` + `/public/locales/ar/translation.json`
- **ALL text content** must have translation keys — no hardcoded strings

