## ♿ Accessibility Requirements (WCAG AA Minimum)

- All interactive elements: visible focus rings (custom styled, not browser default)
- Color contrast ratio ≥ 4.5:1 for normal text, ≥ 3:1 for large text
- All images: descriptive `alt` attributes
- All icons: `aria-label` or `aria-hidden="true"` with adjacent text
- Form inputs: proper `<label>` associations
- Skip-to-main-content link (visually hidden, visible on focus)
- Keyboard navigation: Tab order logical, no keyboard traps
- Landmark roles: `<header>`, `<main>`, `<nav>`, `<section>`, `<footer>` all used

